### Requisicoes prontas para a extensao REST Client.
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@base = http://localhost:8000/api
@modality = MEGA_SENA

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Regras da modalidade
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/rules

### Custo de um volante de 10 dezenas
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/pricing/preview?n=10&games=1

### Tabela completa de precos
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/pricing/table

### Importar planilha (ajuste o caminho do arquivo)
POST {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/draws:import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----LottoLab

------LottoLab
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mega.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./mega.xlsx
------LottoLab--

### Ultimo concurso importado
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/draws/latest

### Concursos paginados
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/draws?limit=10&offset=0

### Lotes de importacao
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/import-batches

### Analise completa
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/analysis

### Recalcular ignorando o cache
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/analysis?refresh=true

### Estatistica por dezena
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/analysis/numbers

### Faixas de padroes
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/analysis/patterns

### Co-ocorrencia e lift
GET {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/analysis/pairs

### Gerar jogos
# @name geracao
POST {{base}}/modalities/{{modality}}/games:generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers_per_game": 7,
  "games": 3,
  "profile": "balanced",
  "seed": 42,
  "budget_limit": 300.00,
  "filters": { "on_already_drawn": "flag" }
}

### Detalhamento do primeiro jogo do lote acima
GET {{base}}/games/{{geracao.response.body.games[0].id}}/insight

### Lote completo
GET {{base}}/game-batches/{{geracao.response.body.batch_id}}

### Leitura da IA sobre o lote
POST {{base}}/game-batches/{{geracao.response.body.batch_id}}/ai-review

### Registrar aposta a partir de um jogo gerado
POST {{base}}/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game_id": "{{geracao.response.body.games[0].id}}",
  "contest_no": 300
}

### Conferir apostas pendentes
POST {{base}}/bets:check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "modality": "{{modality}}" }

### Apostas registradas
GET {{base}}/bets?limit=20

### Resumo financeiro
GET {{base}}/bets/summary
